:2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-VlBFlHwX-Pt6Xyzs9roGw","review_id":"kpfUGOgv9-gfBKjZkjAVJw","date":"2018-03-22T12:29:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9614846706390381,"text_excerpt":"Superior is a classic, old school NOLA staple that is well worth checking out, anytime but especially for the well-reputed and legendary Oyster Happy Hour. Arrive early if you can or make a reservation, because the joint gets popping with good reason. We arrived shortly after Happy Hour began on a Wednesday, and were immediately seated at a beautiful table in the glass side area. Bathed in warm, beautiful sunlight, it is tough to fathom a more ideal spot to dine. Dining with NOLA locals, they were ordering before we even really sat down, and I'm glad they did! I started with a frozen pomegranate mojito, which was on the Happy Hour special (two for one) and was delicious and a perfect way ..."},{"business_id":"-VlBFlHwX-Pt6Xyzs9roGw","review_id":"uepBLwvHAhKNLx_kC9YOlw","date":"2017-11-04T06:12:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9554970264434814,"text_excerpt":"Came here for happy hour with my roommate. We made a reservation 3 hours before on open table and were glad we did because it was packed. We both got a dozen oysters and shared a large frozen mojito. I loved every second of it!! The piano player was a little annoying so I can't imagine how it would be to set in the front room (thank god we were in the back away from it) - I like being able to hear the person I'm eating with!!! Last note - superior seafood's oysters are so fresh. There are some places in nola that do oyster happy hour but they are \"fishy\" and just not good. So despite it being expensive during non-happy hour times I'm sure it's worth it to pay a little more so that you don..."},{"business_id":"-VlBFlHwX-Pt6Xyzs9roGw","review_id":"iKqO9KECDHpI9PMwFiix-w","date":"2017-03-29T17:36:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9538726210594177,"text_excerpt":"My partner and I came down to New Orleans for vacation from New York and stopped in here on our first night and we came back again because it was the best meal we had while we were in town. The ambiance is bustling, with soft lighting and ample seating. The exterior seating area is quite beautiful with tables looking out onto the street. Overall, we ordered: Gulf Coast Oysters ($10) Oysters Superior ($14) -- which includes oysters bienville, oysters rockefeller, and chargrilled oysters. Crabmeat Stuffed Mushrooms ($11) Fried Alligator ($11) Shrimp and Grits ($20) We honestly didn't try anything that we disliked the taste or presentation of, but I'll give you a breakdown anyways.. The gulf..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-VlBFlHwX-Pt6Xyzs9roGw","photo_id":"qoD8CvOx19axeAXglfS0kQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qoD8CvOx19axeAXglfS0kQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8629571795463562},{"business_id":"-VlBFlHwX-Pt6Xyzs9roGw","photo_id":"3axkpOn3Ljai12aqKC30Sw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/3axkpOn3Ljai12aqKC30Sw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8301361799240112},{"business_id":"-VlBFlHwX-Pt6Xyzs9roGw","photo_id":"7ytqRKHkrPvbu_8gQdoenA